{"sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","items":[{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k001","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"진핵 염색체는 DNA와 histone 등 단백질로 구성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k002","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"뉴클레오솜 core는 H2A,H2B,H3,H4 각각 두 분자와 약 147 bp DNA로 구성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k003","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"H1은 linker DNA와 염색질 구조에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k004","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"euchromatin과 heterochromatin은 접근성과 전사 상태가 다른 경향이 있으나 항상 엄격하게 이분되는 것은 아니다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k005","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"중심절은 kinetochore 형성과 분리에 중요하고 말단은 telomere와 보호 단백질로 안정화된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k006","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"유전체에는 단백질 코딩 영역 외에 intron, 조절 영역, 비암호화 RNA 유전자, 반복서열, transposable element 등이 존재한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k007","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"retrotransposon은 RNA 중간체와 역전사를 이용할 수 있고 DNA transposon은 DNA 기반 이동 기작을 사용할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k008","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"염색체의 DNA량은 세포주기에 따라 변화하지만 염색체 수는 중심절 기준으로 세는 것이 일반적이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k009","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"유전자 수, 유전체 크기, 생물의 복잡성 사이에는 단순 비례관계가 없다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k010","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"뉴클레오솜 histone core는 octamer이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k011","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"H1은 core octamer 구성원이 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k012","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"S기에 DNA가 복제되더라도 일반적 중심절 기준 염색체 수는 그대로다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k013","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"retrotransposon과 DNA transposon을 구분한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--genome-structure-k014","sectionId":"gene/genome-structure","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"염색체 수는 46개로 같고 DNA량은 2C에서 4C로 증가한다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}